ill likely best. We can argue that while B has some feedback orientation concerns, they are manageable, and D's adaptability is insufficient to outweigh his crew cooperation issues. So we keep vote B.\n\nWe need to produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON with vote B.\n\nMake sure to reference Sarah's answer. Provide reasoning: B's grumpy/uncooperative may affect feedback, but still less severe than A's inability to take criticism and C's unwillingness to learn. D's adaptability unknown, but his moodiness and loner issues remain.\n\nProceed."}
